    <body>
      <pre id="out">
        "typeof undefined\n=== undefined false == undefined true == null true null == true\nfalsy true falsy same object true\n?? keeps it true || skips it other\nlength true item 0 HTML named x x\nguard   false 0 sanitized\nlive true\n"
      "\n"
